; The signer transcript: what was asked, what was shown, and what was approved,
; bound together so the three cannot disagree.
;
; Offline, like everything a signature covers. No clock -- freshness is checked
; against a time the caller supplies, because a signer that could read a clock
; could be walked into extending its own window.

(library
 (name cosmos_signer)
 (public_name cosmos-signer)
 (libraries cosmos-types cosmos-tx cosmos-crypto digestif))
